<title>JAPAN: Tsukiji Uoichiba -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Tsukiji Uoichiba -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 61.25		vs	   60.79</p>
<p> Operating    loss 62    million    vs   loss 185    million</p>
<p> Current	    170    million    vs	   13    million</p>
<p> Net		   74    million    vs	  113    million</p>
<p> EPS		    3.31 yen	  vs	    5.05 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     22 million	  vs	  22 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   --		 vs		 --</p>
<p>NOTE - Tsukiji Uoichiba Co Ltd is a wholesaler of marine products.</p>
